== report
change: Add tagOwners for tag:ovenlight-app-coach, tag:ovenlight-guest-coach (owner autogroup:admin).
change: Add one rule to grants: alex@example.com may reach tag:ovenlight-app-coach on ports 443 and 8443, as a tagged node is no longer one of your own devices.
change: Add one rule to grants: tag:ovenlight-guest-coach may reach only tag:ovenlight-app-coach:443.
== diff
--- current policy
+++ proposed policy
@@ -1,4 +1,16 @@
 {
+	// Ovenlight: tags for shared app nodes and the guests invited to them (ovenlight setup-sharing).
+	"tagOwners": {
